  "title": "Great Dane Memorial Board, Cold Cast Bronze Plaque, Dog Loss Board, Home and Office Decor, Dog Memorial",
  "description": "A memorial board with small dog bust\n\n- A beautiful memorial board with name, dates and quote\n- CUSTOMIZATION: send us details including your pet&#39;s name and dates of birth and death, so we can personalize your board. Sentence on the golden plate can also be changed.\n- The dimensions of the board are: 34x24 cm / 13.4&quot; x 9.4&quot;\n- The board can be hung on the wall or stand on a shelf.\n- The plaques are made of cold cast bronze which allows us to keep the look and durability of bronze while reducing the price and weight of a figurine. \n- The statues are life-like, made by hand with a great attention to detail and distinctive features of a dog.\n- A perfect addition to a memorial place of your dog.\n- Each piece is individually hand-finished by artisans. \n\nOur high-class art deco plaques are made by hand by the best Polish artist. They are characterized by remarkable precision of workmanship and attention to details, which is visible in the accuracy of representation of distinctive features of the breed. To produce our busts, we use cold cast bronze which allows us to keep the look and durability of bronze and at the same time to reduce the price and weight of a figurine. \n\nWe placed our plaques on a MDF board to create a special memorial sign of your dog. The board is decorated with golden laminate plaque, with engraved details about your dog. We are sure this kind of memorial will bring peace to dog owners who recently lost their beloved pet.\n\nMaterials: Our statues are made from cold cast bronze. This technique uses a mixture of bronze powder with epoxy resin which is poured into a silicone mold. A cast created with this technique looks like a regular bronze statue and is equally cold to touch. Cold cast bronze products are equally valuable artwise as regular bronze statuettes, but are cheaper. The costs of shipping are also lower, which is particularly beneficial in terms of orders sent outside of Europe.\n\nThe board is made of MDF - it has a look of red-brown wood.",
